{"id":"daa141317125dee0","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-ce-preservation.md","title":"c.e. 目标的保持策略及有限限制极限","display":"lem-ce-preservation — c.e. 目标的保持策略及有限限制极限","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-ce-preservation","aliases":["20-lem-ce-preservation"],"display":"lem-ce-preservation — c.e. 目标的保持策略及有限限制极限","chapter":"7","section":"7.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemmas 7.4.2–7.4.3","source_printed_pages":[157],"source_pdf_pages":[191],"depends_on":["[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-ce-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-ce-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ce-preservation — c.e. 目标的保持策略及有限限制极限"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemmas 7.4.2–7.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>157</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,C_s\">\\(A_s,C_s\\)</span> 为统一可计算递增有限集，极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\">\\(A,C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s),r(e,s)\">\\(\\ell(e,s),r(e,s)\\)</span> 采用上游一致长度与限制定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e)|&lt;\\omega\">\\(|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e)|&lt;\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\\ \\land\\ \\exists l_0,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [\\ell(e,s)=l_0\\land r(e,s)=r_0].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\\ \\land\\ \\exists l_0,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [\\ell(e,s)=l_0\\land r(e,s)=r_0].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先取最后一次损伤之后的阶段常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\\)</span>，则真实有限停止计算和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 的逐点稳定使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\">\\(\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(p)\">\\(C(p)\\)</span>：搜索第一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;v\">\\(s&gt;v\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(\\ell(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span>，返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>该输出必须等于最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(p)\">\\(C(p)\\)</span>。否则考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,p\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,p\\}\\)</span> 中在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 之后发生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\to1\">\\(0\\to1\\)</span> 翻转的最小位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。翻转之前，这些位置的停止计算受到限制保护；较大位置先翻转最多把一致长度降到仍不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 翻转后，之前输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的计算与永久为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_t(x)\">\\(C_t(x)\\)</span> 不同。由于限制还包括首个不同位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\ell(e,t)\">\\(x=\\ell(e,t)\\)</span> 的停止 use，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 之前没有新的目标翻转，此不同永久保留，违背真实输出等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。若没有任何翻转，则全部已保护的输出一直正确。由此普通程序加有限常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<p>现取真实输出首个不同或发散位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。足够晚的阶段中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;p\">\\(x&lt;p\\)</span> 的计算、use 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\\upharpoonright(p+1)\">\\(C_s\\upharpoonright(p+1)\\)</span> 已稳定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)\\ge p\">\\(\\ell(e,s)\\ge p\\)</span>。若真实输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 发散，则此后不能出现阶段停止：一旦出现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=p\">\\(x=p\\)</span> 的 use 受到保护，将使真实计算停止。于是此后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=p\">\\(\\ell=p\\)</span>，限制只由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;p\">\\(x&lt;p\\)</span> 的固定 use 组成。若真实输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 停止且不同，则足够晚的阶段显示该固定不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=p\">\\(\\ell=p\\)</span>，限制由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le p\">\\(x\\le p\\)</span> 的固定 use 组成。两种情况均使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,r\">\\(\\ell,r\\)</span> 最终为有限常数。</p>\n<p>这证明同时说明首个不同位置的 use 必须保留，以及 c.e. 目标只能单向翻转的作用。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 7.4.2–7.4.3；印刷页 157；PDF 第 191 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-length-of-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-length-of-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s,C_s","display":false},{"tex":"A,C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s),r(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e)|<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\\ \\land\\ \\exists l_0,r_0,s_0\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\ge s_0\\ [\\ell(e,s)=l_0\\land r(e,s)=r_0].","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C","display":false},{"tex":"C_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"C(p)","display":false},{"tex":"s>v","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)>p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"C(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"0\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"C_t(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x=\\ell(e,t)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"x<p","display":false},{"tex":"C_s\\upharpoonright(p+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)\\ge p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"x=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=p","display":false},{"tex":"x<p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=p","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,r","display":false}],"bytes":2891,"backlinks":[{"id":"617ac90f851b7f95","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-ce-preservation]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]。"},{"id":"3e49539e5d99baea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-ce-preservation]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"9a7da25a4fbbc78c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-ce-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-lowness]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"}],"outgoing":["2e0d85a730fd3a26","18e11f4651f28406","fec296dc8eb84564","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}